OL,2,V55555555CFORD: TUC BACKS
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CSINGLE UNION DEAL
OL,5, The TUC's inner cabinet has voted 11-10
OL,6, to allow a single union deal at the
OL,7, proposed #40m Ford plant in Dundee
OL,8, after 13 hours of talks in London.
OL,10, The Amalgamated Engineering Union will
OL,11, represent the entire workforce, despite
OL,12, protests by T&G leader Ron Todd.
OL,14, AEU leader Gavin Laird said he would
OL,15, wait for the deal to be ratified by the
OL,16, TUC's general council before flying to
OL,17, the United States to see Ford chiefs.
OL,19, Last week, Ford cancelled plans to
OL,20, build the plant after failing to get a
OL,21, single union deal, saying its decision
OL,22, was irrevocable.
OL,23,F]DFrom 22-03-88 / teletextarchive.com
