OL,2,V55555555CFERRIES: P&O AND
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CUNION GO TO ACAS
OL,5, P&O and the seamen's union were today
OL,6, holding fresh talks at the conciliation
OL,7, service ACAS as the threat loomed of an
OL,8, Easter ferry strike.
OL,10, The ferry company is already taking
OL,11, court action to try to stop a union
OL,12, ballot on national industrial action.
OL,14, The National Union of Seamen is taking
OL,15, legal advice on fears it could face
OL,16, sequestration of its assets.
OL,18, The talks which broke down last weekend
OL,19, are over P&O's decision to sack 2,300
OL,20, striking seamen at Dover protesting
OL,21, against the loss of 400 jobs.
OL,23,F]DFrom 22-03-88 / teletextarchive.com
