OL,1,V7w3s7s35E                        CG4/10
OL,2,V55555555CNAVY DOCTORS HELP
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CINJURED GULF CREW
OL,5, Two seamen were killed and 10 others
OL,6, wounded in a double attack by Iranian
OL,7, gunboats on a Norwegian-owned gas
OL,8, carrier in the southern Gulf off Dubai.
OL,10, The British destroyer HMS Exeter sent
OL,11, two doctors to help the wounded after a
OL,12, call for help from a rescue launch.
OL,14, The Iranians raked the Havglimt with
OL,15, gunfire from all sides and fired on tug
OL,16, boats which came to the ship's aid.
OL,18, Thirty-eight minutes after the first
OL,19, attack, the gunboats returned to blast
OL,20, the Havglimt again in one of the most
OL,21, determined attacks in the tanker war.
OL,23,F]DFrom 22-03-88 / teletextarchive.com
