OL,2,V55555555C220 NEWSPAPER
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CPRINTERS TO LOSE JOBS
OL,5, Unions at West Ferry Printers, who
OL,6, print the Daily and Sunday Telegraph
OL,7, in London's Docklands, have been told
OL,8, 220 workers must lose their jobs.
OL,10, The workers are members of the National
OL,11, Graphical Association and SOGAT '82.
OL,13, West Ferry general manager Angus Clark
OL,14, said the company did not need 700
OL,15, printers on the site.
OL,17, The plant will also print southern
OL,18, editions of the Daily Express, Star and
OL,19, Sunday Express from next year. Express
OL,20, Newspapers has a 50% stake in the firm
OL,21, and the Daily Telegraph the other half.
OL,23,F]DFrom 22-03-88 / teletextarchive.com
