OL,6,QGTV-am managing director Bruce Gyngell
OL,7, 58, is recovering in hospital after
OL,8, suffering a heart attack believed to
OL,9, have been caused by overwork.
OL,11, Mr Gyngell has been working seven days
OL,12, a week, starting at 4am, since November
OL,13, when TV-am was hit by the dispute
OL,14, involving 229 technicians.
