OL,2,V55555555CITN GOES INTO
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CTHE NIGHT
OL,4,B
OL,5, ITN is now presenting hourly news
OL,6, bulletins through the night for six of
OL,7, the ITV companies to coincide with the
OL,8, wider introduction of 24-hour TV.
OL,10, The coverage includes the hour-long ITN
OL,11, Morning News at 5am.
OL,13, The new night-time news service will
OL,14, help to double the total transmission
OL,15, time of ITN programmes compared with a
OL,16, year ago.
OL,18, The night-time presenters are Zeinab
OL,19, Badawi and David Cass.
